burn.t.sol
├── when caller burns shares from another account
│  ├── when caller is not the share token owner
│  │  └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
│  └── when caller is the share token owner
│     └── it should decrease the share token balance of the given account by the given amount
└── when caller burns its own shares
   └── it should decrease the share token balance of the caller by the given amount
